amsynth: amsynth (analog modelling synthesizer)
amsynth:
amsynth: amsynth is an analog modelling (aka virtual analog) software
amsynth: synthesizer. It mimics the operation of early analog subtractive
amsynth: synthesizers with classic oscillator waveforms, envelopes, filter,
amsynth: modulation and effects.
amsynth: The aim is to make it easy to create and modify sounds.
amsynth: Amsynth runs as a stand-alone application using JACK, ALSA or OSS,
amsynth: or as a DSSI/LV2/VST plugin.
amsynth:
amsynth: More info: http://amsynth.github.io/
